# Aldous, Soul Contractor

> Aldous is a fighter built around delayed permission, and 2.2.16 shortened the delay. He still converts farm into one stored punch that decides side-lane picks and late fights, but he now trades in lane instead of surrendering it. The catch is unchanged. He needs a team that keeps the map stable while he builds stacks.

